# Lotti Environment Configuration

# Google Identity Services OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Optional)
# If left empty, Lotti automatically provides local student profiles on this device.
# For production Google Sign-In, create a Web Client ID in the Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Authorized JavaScript Origins: http://localhost:5173 (and your production domain)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Note: Gemini AI API Key is configured securely by each user within the app UI (Settings -> Gemini API Key)
# and saved in the user's browser localStorage. Never commit API keys to client-side bundles.
